A problem with my list is that I wrote it for me, and I know that if I've 
got a wand of wishing, I'll alsowant to recharge it (so I don't really 
list that).

Blessed scrolls of charging are only high priority if you find a wand of 
wishing early.  If you get a wish from a fountain or lamp or potion, it's 
a fairly useless wish.  Since my early wishes typically aren't from wands,
I don't list scrolls of charging as critical.

Also, if you've identified a scroll of charging, a blessed magic marker is 
a much better wish.  (I listed it as critical).
